file is too long its recommended to <a class=\"ext\" href=\"https://github.com/ilobilo/stivale2-cs-barebones/blob/main/source/stivale2.cs\" rel=\"noopener\">download</a> it and place under source/</p>\n<h3 id=\"building_and_running_the_kernel\">Building and running the kernel</h3>\n<p>To compile and run the kernel go to main directory (Where limine.cfg, Makefile and source/ are) and run:</p>\n<pre><code>make -j$(nproc --all)</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"see_also\">See Also</h2>\n<h3 id=\"articles\">Articles</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a data-wiki=\"Limine\" href=\"#/library/Limine\">Limine</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"external_links\">External Links</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"ext\" href=\"https://github.com/stivale/stivale/blob/master/STIVALE2.md\" rel=\"noopener\">Stivale2 Specification</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"ext\" href=\"https://github.com/limine-bootloader/limine\" rel=\"noopener\">Limine bootloader</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"ext\" href=\"https://github.com/ilobilo/stivale2-cs-barebones/\" rel=\"noopener\">Project's github repository</a></li>\n</ul>\n","toc":[{"id":"what_is_stivale","text":"What is Stivale?","level":2},{"id":"what_is_limine","text":"What is Limine?","level":2},{"id":"getting_started","text":"Getting started","level":2},{"id":"install_required_packages","text":"Install required packages","level":3},{"id":"actual_code","text":"Actual code","level":3},{"id":"building_and_running_the_kernel","text":"Building and running the kernel","level":3},{"id":"see_also","text":"See Also","level":2},{"id":"articles","text":"Articles","level":3},{"id":"external_links","text":"External Links","level":3}],"categories":["Bare bones tutorials","CSharp","Stivale"],"rating":2,"flags":[],"words":1473,"summary":"stivale means \"boot\" in Italian. It is a boot protocol designed to overcome shortcomings of common boot protocols used by hobbyist OS developers, such as Multiboot .","updated":"2022-04-03","authors":["Ilobilo"],"url":"https://wiki.osdev.org/Stivale2_CSharp_BareBones","history":"h